@baseUrl = http://localhost:4010

### no credentials: 401 and a WWW-Authenticate challenge
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/ten_acme/products

### a wrong token: still 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/ten_acme/products
Authorization: Bearer tok_not_real

### a valid Acme token asking for Globex: 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/ten_globex/products
Authorization: Bearer tok_acme_admin

### the matching tenant works
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/ten_acme/products?limit=1
Authorization: Bearer tok_acme_admin

### support can read but cannot create products
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/ten_acme/products
Authorization: Bearer tok_acme_support
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SUP-001",
  "slug": "support-product",
  "name": "Support Product",
  "priceCents": 100,
  "currency": "USD",
  "stock": 1
}

### an admin of the same tenant can create
# @capture createdId = $.id
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/ten_acme/products
Authorization: Bearer tok_acme_admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "ADM-001",
  "slug": "admin-product",
  "name": "Admin Product",
  "priceCents": 100,
  "currency": "USD",
  "stock": 1
}

### a platform admin may work across tenants
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/ten_globex/products?limit=1
Authorization: Bearer tok_platform

### a tenant that does not exist is 403, not a hint that it is missing
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/ten_ghost/products
Authorization: Bearer tok_platform
